
### Language API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004
@candidateId = 1
@resumeId = 1
@languageId = 1

### 1. Add English
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/languages
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languageName": "English",
  "proficiency": "FLUENT",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 2. Add Estonian
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/languages
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languageName": "Estonian",
  "proficiency": "NATIVE",
  "displayOrder": 2
}

### 3. Get all languages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/languages

### 4. Update language
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/languages/{{languageId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languageName": "English",
  "proficiency": "PROFESSIONAL",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 5. Delete language
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/languages/{{languageId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
